            "explanation": "The final paragraph says side reactions gradually consume active material and reduce deliverable capacity, so an aged cell has less usable active material. The claim about connecting cells in series misapplies paragraph 3: series connection raises voltage in a new design and does not restore a degraded cell's capacity."
